[{"title":"观华康伯画山水","author":"浦坦","text":"东湖先生高且闲，造化在手开荆关。\n春风吹林入笔底，树杪雨歇飞潺湲。\n江光闪闪烁霞赤，沙鸟离离渡溪夕。\n宛然鸡犬喧前村，疑有当年避秦客。\n水亭春还花正香，渔翁坐钓青丝长。\n落花一片迥波绿，不碍溪头白鸥浴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21025,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闾江","author":"潘绪","text":"雨余桃浪浸渔矶，鸭绿溶溶好染衣。\n我欲南湖寻乐事，买舟来乘鳜鱼肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21026,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白石山","author":"潘绪","text":"草树生香绝路尘，行歌樵采不逢人。\n白头自得烟霞趣，功业无心学买臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21027,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六月二十三日纲庵携酌于元大竹林避暑以敬修韵赠纲庵","author":"潘绪","text":"黄尘道上绝行车，避暑时来野水涯。\n簟展南州徐稚榻，樽开北海邺侯家。\n风情未老歌桃叶，儿子将看折桂花。\n更向东邻寻乐事，竹林深处最清华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21028,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春过南浦","author":"潘宝","text":"江上人家春水西，桃花短短压墙低。\n可怜十日东风恶，红雨满林啼竹鸡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21029,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与缉熙同访莫云楼","author":"潘宝","text":"朝看日影漾波纹，卓午风和日又曛。\n遥指吟篷烟水上，两三人醉一楼云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21030,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋感","author":"潘晦","text":"湛露下百草，众叶日以凋。\n西斋绝尘迹，从篁自萧萧。\n凉飙闯然来，纨扇不复摇。\n黄鹄亦秉时，翱翔在层霄。\n美人隔湘浦，望望不可招。\n我欲从之游，江水一何遥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21031,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二泉寺退归听松庵和王学士见寄","author":"普真","text":"泉上归来已一年，万松阴里屋三椽。\n坐浅白日浑无事，买断清风不费钱。\n猿堕山崖寻果树，鹤穿林径避茶烟。\n王猷识我平生意，时寄新诗一两篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21032,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谈君思永新复惠山唐张祜题诗处并勒诗于石诗以美之","author":"秦禾","text":"曲径扪萝上，谁嫌步屧迟。\n空山犹太古，小洞立多时。\n旧竹青仍在，新莎绿更滋。\n谈公老好事，镌石记唐诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21033,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"复碧山吟社","author":"秦瀚","text":"一亭十老二泉南，前辈风流燕子谙。\n双柚花开春又晚，九峰云起碧犹涵。\n尚留漉酒陶巾在，尽许游山阮屐探。\n从此吟声落龙缝，如琴如筑佛灯龛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21034,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"后岩举吟社中秋后二日流馨亭落成","author":"秦瀚","text":"泉上堂成户牖虚，新凉冲雨过轩车。\n为怜石罅流瀺灂，又喜林间杂佩琚。\n鼓瑟音稀何穆穆，到池声静只如如。\n何人更解无弦趣，流水高山听有余。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21035,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迂泉八月十八日举碧山社会和华补庵韵","author":"秦瀚","text":"碧山稀社会，久矣得时清。\n何意干戈后，未闻歌吹声。\n亭台喜如故，草树幸重生。\n物理无庸问，应怜丘壑情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21036,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绮塍西园赏菊","author":"秦瀚","text":"篱菊殿秋芳，寒姿照山色。\n主人好护持，燕赏劳呼客。\n幽轩坐清芬，迥与尘几隔。\n我况遗世徒，膏肓在泉石。\n来订岁寒盟，招隐谢旃白。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21037,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金钱花","author":"秦瀚","text":"重惜金钱贵，刚开半日花。\n吾庭多野卉，此种亦奇葩。\n夜想水冲散，晓看天雨斜。\n若堪购书读，不负种儒家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21038,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惠山寺次姚广孝韵","author":"秦柄","text":"客径缘溪入，禅关背日开。\n竹深清磬出，潭静白云来。\n碍树山中断，映池松倒栽。\n劳尊临曲水，绝胜晋人杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21039,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林泉山房二首 其一","author":"秦柄","text":"自入山中住，翛然物外群。\n齑盐僧饭合，藜火佛灯分。\n闭户深寒木，开窗带湿云。\n时因意到处，一诵太玄文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21040,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林泉山房二首 其二","author":"秦柄","text":"岩栖夙有志，兹地聊相娱。\n旧迹怀桑苧，幽踪托苾刍。\n经寒林雨薄，入暮岭云孤。\n愿效刘吁筑，终焉遂隐图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21041,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其一 嘉树堂","author":"秦耀","text":"嘉木围清流，草堂置其上。\n周遭林樾深，倒影池中漾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21042,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其二 清响斋","author":"秦耀","text":"绕屋皆筼筜，高斋自幽敞。\n时和寒鸟鸣，泠泠滴清响。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21043,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其三 锦汇漪","author":"秦耀","text":"灼灼夭桃花，涟漪互相向。\n水底烂朱霞，林端日初上。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21044,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其四 清籞","author":"秦耀","text":"竹光冷到地，幔卷湘云绿。\n隔坞清风来，声声戛寒玉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21045,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其五 知鱼槛","author":"秦耀","text":"涧外秋水足，策策复堂堂。\n焉知我非鱼，此乐思蒙庄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21046,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其六 清川华薄","author":"秦耀","text":"映水列轩窗，林峦森在瞩。\n塘坳聚落花，溪流出茅屋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21047,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其七 涵碧亭","author":"秦耀","text":"中流击孤艇，危亭四无壁。\n微风水上来，衣与寒潭碧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21048,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其八 悬淙涧","author":"秦耀","text":"淙淙乳泉落，涧道石林幽。\n寻声穷其源，杖履多三休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21049,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其九 卧云堂","author":"秦耀","text":"白云已出岫，复此还山谷。\n幽人卧其间，常抱白云宿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21050,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其十 邻梵阁","author":"秦耀","text":"高阁邻招提，天花落如雨。\n时闻钟梵声，维摩此中住。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21051,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其十一 大石山房","author":"秦耀","text":"寒崖挂苍藤，一石塞云栋。\n夜半月明中，天风吹欲动。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21052,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其十二 丹邱小隐","author":"秦耀","text":"小隐人间世，神仙安可求。\n吾将炼大药，即次是丹邱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21053,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其十三 环翠楼","author":"秦耀","text":"登楼展幽步，俯见林壑美。\n落日凭阑干，当窗四山翠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21054,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其十四 先月榭","author":"秦耀","text":"斜阳堕西岭，芳榭先得月。\n流连玩清景，忘言坐来夕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21055,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其十五 鹤步滩","author":"秦耀","text":"独鹤前山归，从容步浅渚。\n望远时一鸣，临流刷毛羽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21056,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其十六 含贞斋","author":"秦耀","text":"盘桓抚孤松，千载怀渊明。\n岁寒挺高节，吾自含吾贞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21057,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其十七 爽台","author":"秦耀","text":"晓起昐青苍，天空绝尘坱。\n排闼两山开，轩窗致高爽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21058,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其十八 飞泉","author":"秦耀","text":"雨溢忽飞泉，泉流注深谷。\n我欲往从之，褰裳濯吾足。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21059,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其十九 凌虚阁","author":"秦耀","text":"飞瓮耸碧虚，临下如无地。\n九阍若可扪，从此吁上帝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21060,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄畅园二十咏 其二十 栖元堂","author":"秦耀","text":"独抱违时蕴，幽栖岁月深。\n太元犹未草，我异子云心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21061,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李相读书台","author":"秦耀","text":"丹柰花开春雨余，半趺满坐偶僧庐。\n钟声日暮荒台上，曾是先生旧读书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21062,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱塘怀古","author":"秦堈","text":"此地繁华已饱闻，却来怀古独情殷。\n湖心倒浸梁朝寺，峰顶常含宋代云。\n夹岸楼台还匼匝，四时箫鼓自纷纭。\n卯山宫阙荒烟里，只有疏钟送夕曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21063,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惠山诗次先淮海同东坡先生酬和韵三首 其一","author":"秦堈","text":"六丁握神斧，搥破云根苍。\n嵌空寒液迸，辟此漪澜堂。\n堂前罗松柏，白鹤从空翔。\n掬水偶一盥，莹然冰玉光。\n沦茗色味绝，入口回清香。\n独立出尘表，旷然百虑忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21064,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惠山诗次先淮海同东坡先生酬和韵三首 其二","author":"秦堈","text":"空传南朝寺，不见南朝人。\n松桂日以老，青山日以新。\n清泉其白石，万古光磷磷。\n三千珠履客，转眼成灰尘。\n俯仰今昔事，浩歌问苍旻。\n搔首月东出，长此烟霞邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21065,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惠山诗次先淮海同东坡先生酬和韵三首 其三","author":"秦堈","text":"山影落空潭，泉声走长樾。\n声影两无碍，观听俱奇绝。\n是名青莲界，所以无生灭。\n捻残十老髭，踏破一轮月。\n坐拥竹炉烟，静待岩花发。\n风韵如在兹，愿言继高辙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21066,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陆子泉","author":"秦璠","text":"达人不作千年计，志士常怀万物情。\n陆子自能耽此水，二泉吾得濯其清。\n明明夜月亭间竹，日日秋风谷底铛。\n头白一瓢知冷暖，抱琴高卧听松声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21067,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泰伯墓","author":"秦璠","text":"梅村东去皇山上，高出勾吴泰伯坟。\n万乘不亲惟礼义，二仪相接正氤氲。\n狐狸满路悲秋雨，凤鸟无声隔暮云。\n再向千年看季子，后来辞让只虚文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21068,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"范蠡城","author":"秦璠","text":"兵家轻发是亡师，二十余年计弗迟。\n主辱岂堪防鸟喙，功成犹自感鸱夷。\n风尘渺渺夫椒恨，烟浪茫茫笠泽思。\n海舶未遥臣种死，留侯能不一攀追。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21069,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华宝祠","author":"秦璠","text":"周孔去来人道弱，悠然见子表南齐。\n终身父命难违背，万古天心岂缪迷。\n青简孝名乘宇宙，白头遗像照山溪。\n舜之不告缘无后，若解行权也可妻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21070,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张古山","author":"秦用中","text":"青山万仞窥星躔，攀跻直上芒鞋穿。\n山头一片石，可坐还可眠。\n根盘元气长不息，直与太行太华遥相连。\n骑驴老子归何处，丹龟磨灭虚无间。\n闲云吞吐自朝夕，幽花开落空碎年。\n崔嵬复崔嵬，屹立势欲凌飞仙，碧霄擎出双青莲。\n将军矢死玉台古，东望赤气弥云烟。\n渔歌欸乃杳无际，极目千里江吞天。\n柴门临流绝低小，白沙翠竹何娟娟。\n匡庐之秀远可挹，东湖尘土凭谁湔。\n众芳摇落锦江冷，芙蓉木末手可搴。\n离离寒色日将暝，一声老鹰来湖壖。\n尼邱天开高几许，夜深飞梦何悠然。\n泉流石壁半空泻，耳边恍若松风万壑调冰弦。\n浮云看破变苍狗，有约九龙之山太湖之滨，飘乎白日朗诵归来篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21071,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"顾亭之斋中看菊书赠二首 其一","author":"秦重泰","text":"老向纬编穷理惯，秋来小圃种花忙。\n一床书卷一丛菊，静对萧斋发古香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21072,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"顾亭之斋中看菊书赠二首 其二","author":"秦重泰","text":"粉白鹅黄浅间深，霜天常伴静中吟。\n何须比似陶元亮，萧淡偏宜养道心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21073,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中登虎丘寺楼","author":"秦仲锡","text":"病里独登楼，楼前古寺秋。\n霜寒红叶径，雨过白蘋洲。\n药裹随身好，诗怀到处幽。\n明朝欲归去，又上木兰舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21074,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日即事","author":"秦念桥","text":"独眠春夜短，白日满房栊。\n脱珥供儿读，穿针诲女工。\n花香熏蝶梦，鸟语碎东风。\n莫负晴和景，临轩解闷容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21075,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游惠山邹副使园见其遗妾缝衣有感","author":"秦念桥","text":"境是旧游处，苍凉非昔年。\n疏花全著莽，小沼半藏烟。\n掺手缝要襋，当时按管弦。\n始知铜雀恨，应为一潸然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21076,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日游东郊","author":"秦念桥","text":"西过危墙复转东，浅苔荒径送微风。\n沿溪弱柳参差绿，夹岸夭桃深浅红。\n几片白云归远岫，数家茅舍傍牛宫。\n春来万物皆舒郁，惟我穷途不暂通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21077,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与邵国贤夜话东林","author":"钱文","text":"洗空诗障天河水，平荡高怀太岳云。\n今夜江清星月冷，两人无睡话斯文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21078,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新宅","author":"钱文","text":"安稳茅柴屋数间，起来开眼见南山。\n千帆白日墙头过，一鸟青天树杪还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21079,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜步","author":"钱文","text":"睡熟城中石湾家，老夫乘兴步江沙。\n白龙西浦青杨树，挂起蓑衣月正斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21080,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瀼上","author":"钱文","text":"贴天河汉影西流，络纬莎鸡一片秋。\n草帐夜凉人卧病，老怀添记世间愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21081,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题菊","author":"钱文","text":"野菊斑斑澹月华，青天如纸雁行斜。\n寒香留到冰霜地，不见江南百草花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21082,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔村夜咏","author":"钱文","text":"竹榻无眠夜始遥，草虫催织竞喓喓。\n秋来风水生凉冷，忆在吴淞第四桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21083,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同盛中丞宿惠山松风阁二首 其一","author":"钱文","text":"老卿文采压江淹，挈我高栖发野潜。\n松阁静临龙虎窟，瀑布寒挂水晶帘。\n正须时节黄花好，肯爱川原碧草纤。\n夜半惠连诗梦破，诸天星斗共清严。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21084,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同盛中丞宿惠山松风阁二首 其二","author":"钱文","text":"鹤迹无能叹又淹，偶随时跃与时潜。\n九峰寒照天平帽，一壑翠涛风满帘。\n玉应金和逢盛事，今来古往付秾纤。\n两忘人势何多幸，却笑山僧律戒严。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21085,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林堂读书","author":"钱允","text":"松云苍翠石泉清，茅屋人家远俗情。\n猿鹤未归秋寂寂，隔林时听读书声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21086,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枯荷鹡鸰图","author":"钱允","text":"霜落秋荷叶渐残，西风原上鹡鸰单。\n翻思煮豆燃萁者，能似沙禽念急难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21087,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏子游赤壁图","author":"钱纲","text":"月明乌鹊夜南飞，横槊歌残赤壁矶。\n自有周郎能顾曲，不妨苏子赋星稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21088,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏子游赤壁","author":"钱纲","text":"载酒来游赤壁矶，月明乌鹊夜南飞。\n披图遥想人何在，山水依然澹夕晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21089,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同邵二泉访一诚秦先生于沙头因游祝山韵","author":"钱荣","text":"十载红尘此胜游，麦风吹雨半湖秋。\n沿村碧柳眠还起，罨画青山影自浮。\n范老行藏余百世，太湖吞吐只三州。\n闲闲鸥鹭飞来去，只笑芦花白了头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21090,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙卯二月二日秦从川邀入吟社感赋","author":"钱宪","text":"春社临芳墅，青林变渚禽。\n题襟非汉上，修褉继山阴。\n花气熏飞斝，泉声答雅琴。\n宝华留古刹，空翠入遥岑。\n献岁开新赏，良辰喜盍簪。\n追欢兴无那，刻竹纪清吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21091,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过石濑山庄次郑平山寅丈韵","author":"钱文爵","text":"低擅千秋胜，泉流三径分。\n涧芳生暮色，石壁乱春云。\n幽意花同惬，岩香鸟共闻。\n到来余远思，萝月绿纷纷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21092,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日抒怀次韵","author":"钱高","text":"衡门掩白昼，芳树霭清阴。\n翳此桑榆晚，而无车马音。\n梁空飞燕入，径僻落花深。\n愿慕羲皇叟，悠然上古心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21093,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溽暑","author":"钱高","text":"溽暑夜无寐，披襟户不扃。\n烟开千嶂月，风定一江星。\n露草虫声咽，鱼罾水气腥。\n翛然尘虑绝，太上欲忘形。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21094,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]